IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc6-builders`
IMPORT `ccc6-prohibition-orders`
IMPORT `ccc6-tests-support`

-- Tests for ss 161 and 162.2. Expected values decided from the text before each run.

`s 161 test s 787(1) penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` `six months`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `a fine in the discretion of the court`, `no fine is stated`
`s 161 test summary penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, `imprisonment for a term of` `six months`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `a fine in the discretion of the court`, `no fine is stated`
`s 161 test offence under this Act` MEANS `s 161(1.1)(a) an offence under this Act`

